menu "WiFi Radio Block Configuration"

    config WIFI_SSID
        string "WiFi SSID"
        default "myssid"
        help
            Bench-test fallback SSID. TODO next stage: superseded by the
            SPIFFS-backed single-SSID config store (WIFI.SET over the
            serial CLI) once that lands - this Kconfig value only matters
            until then.

    config WIFI_PASSWORD
        string "WiFi Password"
        default "mypassword"
        help
            Bench-test fallback password. See WIFI_SSID above - same
            caveat applies.

endmenu
